# Turning a cloaked creature face up is a special action for its card's mana cost (CR 701.58b, 116.2b), and a Phyrexian
# symbol in that cost may be paid with 2 life (CR 107.4f), announced as it is for a cast or an activation (CR 601.2b).
# Cryptic Coat cloaks Phyrexian Metamorph ({3}{U/P}); with only Sol Ring's {2} and Mox Sapphire's {U} - {3} - the action is
# offered, and Bot1 pays the {U/P} with 2 life: 20 - 2 = 18. Face up, the Metamorph is a 0/0 that copies nothing (it did not
# enter, CR 708.8), so it is put into the graveyard, and the Coat stays.
#
# Black Lotus pays the Coat; the Island casts Sol Ring.

